abstract: "A facts-first synthetic benchmark and agent evaluation environment for Digital Governance Framework gates. DGF-Bench operationalizes concepts from the accompanying paper The Last Human Gate through route-aware execution, shared evidence, interactive tools, hidden ground truth, Azure architecture evidence, and OpenRouter model evaluation."
